<title>SPAIN: ATHLETICS-WORLD HALF-MARATHON CHAMPIONSHIPS RESULTS.</title>
<headline>ATHLETICS-WORLD HALF-MARATHON CHAMPIONSHIPS RESULTS.</headline>
